                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[b]Graphics/maps/textures[/b] Seems outdated by todays standarts but very functional\n[b]Gameplay story(singleplayer)[/b] Typical tower defence with caviat, that sometimes you have surprsie attacks and you can gain economical advantage by saving up money\n[b]Gameplay Multiplayer/co-op[/b] NA\n[b]Music[/b] OK\n[b]Controls[/b] Just mouse\n[b]Mods[/b] N/A\nFinal thoughts:\nVery satisfying game which would run on any potato PC and will give a lot of hours of fun. Solid gameplay experience. I enjoyed every level, and found value of replaying levels in higher difficulty (for achievements and for fun). Too bad company which made this game bankrupted\n\nfor more statistics click here v\nhttps://steamcharts.com/app/206690",
